questions.question:
Perhatikan kode sistem lampu otomatis berikut:
int val = analogRead(A0);
if (val > 700) { digitalWrite(LED, LOW); } else { digitalWrite(LED, HIGH); }
Jika sensor LDR dirangkai sehingga nilainya meningkat saat kondisi makin gelap, bagaimana perilaku LED tersebut?

questions.question_en:
Consider the code snippet for an automatic lighting system:
int val = analogRead(A0);
if (val > 700) { digitalWrite(LED, LOW); } else { digitalWrite(LED, HIGH); }
If the LDR sensor circuit produces higher values in dark conditions, how will the LED behave?
